<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-CHANG BEATS HENMAN IN AUSTRALIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHANG BEATS HENMAN IN AUSTRALIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American number two seed Michael Chang beat Britain's Tim Henman in straight sets in their Australian Open third round match on Friday.</p>
<p>Chang won 6-1 7-6 (7-3) 6-3.</p>
</text>
